      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I have a clear picture. The test file contains only one actual test method (`test_Chronology_range`) but is polluted with many unused data provider methods and imports from a larger parent test class. I'll produce a clean version that removes dead code and improves readability.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes all unused data provider methods and imports from the original file, introduces a local `chrono` variable to eliminate repetition of `InternationalFixedChronology.INSTANCE`, and groups the assertions by field category with brief comments explaining the non-obvious variable-range semantics for special days."
